+
+# Task
+
+Implement JSON Pointer (RFC 6901) in `src/index.ts`, exported as `resolvePointer(document, pointer)`.
+
+## Acceptance criteria
+
+- Returns the value the pointer refers to; `""` refers to the whole document.
+- Pointer syntax: empty, or a sequence of `/`-prefixed reference tokens; `~1` decodes to `/`, `~0` to `~`
+  (in that order); any other `~` escape throws.
+- Pointer not starting with `/` (and not empty) throws.
+- Object members are looked up by exact key, own properties only (no prototype lookup).
+- Array indices: `0` or digits with no leading zero; `-` and non-canonical indices throw; out of range throws.
+- Traversal into a primitive or `null` throws; a missing member throws.
+- A member whose value is `null` resolves to `null`.
